OL,3,ARight-wing commentator Milo
OL,4,AYiannopoulos detained by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish political commentator Milo
OL,7,FYiannopoulos, who has been a vocal
OL,8,Fsupporter of US President Donald Trump,
OL,9,Fwas apparently detained by Immigration
OL,10,Fand Customs Enforcement (ICE),
OL,11,Faccording to the agency's records.
OL,13,FYiannopoulos, 41, a former editor of
OL,14,Fthe right-wing US website Breitbart and
OL,15,Femployee of rapper Kanye West, appears
OL,16,Fto be held in Louisiana, according to a
OL,17,Fsearch of ICE's inmate registry.
OL,19,FThe self-styled provocateur has called
OL,20,Fhimself the "most fabulous supervillain
OL,21,Fon the internet". His critics call him
OL,22,Fa purveyor of hate speech.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
